</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S3.T3.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:165.6pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 3: </span>Ablation study about the hyperparameter sensitivity analysis of <math id="S3.T3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>. <span id="S3.T3.fig2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span> and <span id="S3.T3.fig2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">blue</span> stand for the best and second best result. With <math id="S3.T3.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=0.6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=0.6</annotation></semantics></math> balancing early and late stage, the best performance of image quality, unmasked region preservation and text alignment are achieved.</figcaption>
<div id="S3.T3.fig2.11" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:165.6pt;height:32.8pt;vertical-align:-15.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-101.6pt,20.2pt) scale(0.44901302417931,0.44901302417931) ;">
